# The same without immediate leave: the leave only shortens the membership to
# robustness x last-member interval (2 s at the defaults), and the row goes
# when that runs out. A leave from a port that never joined changes nothing.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
5 v2leave 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
5 v2leave 2 0 192.168.1.11 239.1.1.1
